00:01:08.135 --> 00:01:11.505 size:53% position:73% line:53%
LAURENCE VACHER, dir. de prod.,

00:01:09.336 --> 00:01:12.706 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mikros Animation Montréal

00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:13.941 size:53% position:73% line:53%
