00:01:45.973 --> 00:01:49.143 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:01:47.007 --> 00:01:50.377 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Extraction moto!

00:01:48.242 --> 00:01:51.579 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Grâce à des projets comme

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:52.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
